BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260908T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260908T180000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Online SRJC Libraries Tour
DESCRIPTION:Highlights: This tour will last 30 minutes + opportunity for 
 Q&amp\;A  Find out how to borrow FREE textbooks\, books\, calculators\, l
 aptops\, phone chargers\, AND more!  Learn about research help: Drop-in D
 esk\, Online Chat\, Online Tutorials\, and Research Appointments...and th
 e kinds of research questions students ask!  Discover how to access print
  and online books\, journals\, magazines\, and streaming videos.  Learn a
 bout individual and group study space options\, including technology-infu
 sed study rooms.  Extra Credit: As students\, you have the option to subm
 it your instructor and course name when you register if your instructor i
 s offering extra credit and you would like us to notify your instructor t
 hat you have attended. Or\, you can work with your instructor on an alter
 native way to provide evidence of your attendance.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Highlights: This tour will last 30 minu
 tes + opportunity for Q&amp\;A</p><p>  Find out how to borrow FREE textbo
 oks\, books\, calculators\, laptops\, phone chargers\, AND more!<br />  L
 earn about research help: Drop-in Desk\, Online Chat\, Online Tutorials\,
  and Research Appointments...and the kinds of research questions students
  ask!<br />  Discover how to access print and online books\, journals\, m
 agazines\, and streaming videos.<br />  Learn about individual and group 
 study space options\, including technology-infused study rooms.</p><p>  E
 xtra Credit: As students\, you have the option to submit your instructor 
 and course name when you register if your instructor is offering extra cr
 edit and you would like us to notify your instructor that you have attend
 ed. Or\, you can work with your instructor on an alternative way to provi
 de evidence of your attendance.</p>
