X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T160000
LOCATION:Burbank Circle/Bertolini Quad - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Second Chance Car Show
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the fun\, this event is also an opportunity to raise a
 wareness and help reduce the stigma surrounding justice-impacted students
 . We welcome everyone to come together\, learn\, connect\, and celebrate 
 our students and our community.  This will be a family-friendly event fea
 turing a car show\, food trucks\, music and a live DJ\, face painting\, c
 ommunity resources\, and more.  General admission is free.For information
  about the Second Chance program\, visit SRJC's Rising Scholars website. 
 (https://rising-scholars.santarosa.edu/about-us)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Beyond the fun\, this event is also an 
 opportunity to raise awareness and help reduce the stigma surrounding jus
 tice-impacted students. We welcome everyone to come together\, learn\, co
 nnect\, and celebrate our students and our community.</p><p>  This will b
 e a family-friendly event featuring a car show\, food trucks\, music and 
 a live DJ\, face painting\, community resources\, and more.</p><p>  Gener
 al admission is free.</p><p><a href="https://rising-scholars.santarosa.ed
