LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Cite It Right with NoodleTools: MLA + APA
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, you will learn how to sign up for an accou
 nt with NoodleTools. We will also provide examples to show how to create 
 citations\, create a bibliography and check for errors. There will be tim
 e to ask questions at the end of the overview —bring your sources along
 . Join us and learn how to cite your sources right!  This NoodleTools wor
 kshop will focus on the MLA + APA citation styles. Check with your instru
 ctor to confirm the citation style appropriate for your research assignme
 nt. When writing a research paper\, the discipline typically determines t
 he citation style you will use.  Extra Credit: As students\, you have the
  option to submit your instructor and course name when you register if yo
 u would like us to notify your instructor that you have attended the work
 shop for extra credit. Or\, you can work with your instructor on an alter
 native way to provide evidence of your attendance.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  In this workshop\, you will learn how t
 o sign up for an account with NoodleTools. We will also provide examples 
 to show how to create citations\, create a bibliography and check for err
 ors. There will be time to ask questions at the end of the overview —br
 ing your sources along. Join us and learn how to cite your sources right!
 </p><p>  This NoodleTools workshop will focus on the MLA + APA citation s
 tyles. Check with your instructor to confirm the citation style appropria
 te for your research assignment. When writing a research paper\, the disc
 ipline typically determines the citation style you will use.</p><p>  Extr
 a Credit: As students\, you have the option to submit your instructor and
  course name when you register if you would like us to notify your instru
 ctor that you have attended the workshop for extra credit. Or\, you can w
 ork with your instructor on an alternative way to provide evidence of you
 r attendance.</p>
