SUMMARY:Navigating Research with AI Tools at SRJC Libraries
DESCRIPTION:Navigating Research with AI Tools at SRJC Libraries @ 3pm\, S
 ept 22 (via Zoom) Online  AI apps can empower researchers to discover top
 ic connections and identify areas for further exploration. Librarian Cano
 n Crawford will focus on responsible research practices and academic inte
 grity while exploring AI tools at SRJC Libraries.  Workshop Details: Extr
 a Credit available!  As students\, you have the option to submit your ins
 tructor and course name when you register if your instructor is offering 
 extra credit and you would like us to notify your instructor that you hav
 e attended. Or\, you can work with your instructor on an alternative way 
 to provide evidence of your attendance.
