  practices and academic integrity while exploring AI tools at SRJC Librar
 ies.</p><p><br />  Workshop Details: Extra Credit available!</p><p>  As s
 tudents\, you have the option to submit your instructor and course name w
 hen you register if your instructor is offering extra credit and you woul
 d like us to notify your instructor that you have attended. Or\, you can 
