BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T180000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Cite It Right with NoodleTools: MLA + APA
DESCRIPTION:This NoodleTools workshop will focus on the MLA + APA citatio
 n styles. Check with your instructor to confirm the citation style approp
 riate for your research assignment. When writing a research paper\, the d
 iscipline typically determines the citation style you will use.  In this 
 workshop\, you will learn how to sign up for an account with NoodleTools.
  We will also provide examples to show how to create citations\, create a
  bibliography and check for errors. There will be time to ask questions a
 t the end of the overview —bring your sources along. Join us and learn 
 how to cite your sources right!  Extra Credit: As students\, you have the
  option to submit your instructor and course name when you register if yo
 u would like us to notify your instructor that you have attended the work
 shop for extra credit. Or\, you can work with your instructor on an alter
 native way to provide evidence of your attendance.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This NoodleTools workshop will focus on
  the MLA + APA citation styles. Check with your instructor to confirm the
  citation style appropriate for your research assignment. When writing a 
 research paper\, the discipline typically determines the citation style y
 ou will use.</p><p>  In this workshop\, you will learn how to sign up for
  an account with NoodleTools. We will also provide examples to show how t
 o create citations\, create a bibliography and check for errors. There wi
 ll be time to ask questions at the end of the overview —bring your sour
 ces along. Join us and learn how to cite your sources right!</p><p>  Extr
 a Credit: As students\, you have the option to submit your instructor and
  course name when you register if you would like us to notify your instru
 ctor that you have attended the workshop for extra credit. Or\, you can w
 ork with your instructor on an alternative way to provide evidence of you
 r attendance.</p>
UID:20260930T000000Z-23873@calendar.santarosa.edu
