LOCATION:Bertolini Quad and Student Activities Center - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:2nd Annual Disability Culture Fest
DESCRIPTION:We will have free pizza from Mozzeria (A Deaf owned and Opera
 ted Food Truck from San Francisco!) for the first two hundred attendees\,
  as well as a Disability Community Art Show in the Student Activity Cente
 r\, resource tabling from over 30 organizations and campus departments\, 
 accessible yoga\, yard games\, and more!Learn more about the Disability C
 ultural Center on the SRJC Disability Resources website. (https://drd.san
 tarosa.edu/dcc)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  We will have free pizza from Mozzeria (
 A Deaf owned and Operated Food Truck from San Francisco!) for the first t
 wo hundred attendees\, as well as a Disability Community Art Show in the 
 Student Activity Center\, resource tabling from over 30 organizations and
  campus departments\, accessible yoga\, yard games\, and more!</p><p><a h
 ref="https://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn 
 more about the Disability Cultural Center on the SRJC Disability Resource
 s website.</a></p>
