BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T200000
LOCATION:Carole L. Ellis Auditorium - SRJC Petaluma Campus
SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show - Fall Cinema Series
DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Cinema Series is a unique\, film education progr
 am that mixes the Santa Rosa Junior College campus community with residen
 ts of Sonoma County to screen and discuss significant classic and modern 
 cinema. Within the series\, our Filmmakers in Conversation program regula
 rly hosts directors\, actors\, and motion picture technicians.  Guest eve
 nings are generally structured with a 6pm talk or filmmaker interview\, a
  7pm screening\, and a question &amp\; answer session following the film.
   The program is hosted in the Carole L. Ellis Auditorium on the SRJC Pet
 aluma Campus. Films are projected in 4K with 7.1 sound.For more informati
 on\, visit the Petaluma Film Alliance website. (https://petalumafilmallia
 nce.org/2026-fall-schedule/)&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Petaluma Cinema Series is a unique\
 , film education program that mixes the Santa Rosa Junior College campus 
 community with residents of Sonoma County to screen and discuss significa
 nt classic and modern cinema. Within the series\, our Filmmakers in Conve
 rsation program regularly hosts directors\, actors\, and motion picture t
 echnicians.</p><p>  Guest evenings are <em>generally</em> structured with
  a 6pm talk or filmmaker interview\, a 7pm screening\, and a question &am
 p\; answer session following the film.</p><p>  The program is hosted in t
 he Carole L. Ellis Auditorium on the SRJC Petaluma Campus. Films are proj
 ected in 4K with 7.1 sound.</p><p><a href="https://petalumafilmalliance.o
 rg/2026-fall-schedule/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informati
 on\, visit the Petaluma Film Alliance website.</a>&#160\;</p>
