BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T110000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Zack Darling - Human Agency & Machine Inquiry
DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher
  education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\
 , but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities
  for research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depend
 s entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Zack Darling is an award win
 ning brand builder with decades of experience in strategy\, development\,
  experiential design\, and fabrication.Learn more on the SRJC Computer St
 udies' AI Talks website. (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  As generative AI becomes embedded acros
 s disciplines\, higher education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle b
 etween opposing camps\, but of intentional design.</p><p>  Generative sys
 tems offer novel capabilities for research\, creation\, and learning\, ye
 t their ultimate value depends entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them
 .</p><p><strong>Zack Darling</strong> is an award winning brand builder w
 ith decades of experience in strategy\, development\, experiential design
 \, and fabrication.</p><p><a href="https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026
 " target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies'
  AI Talks website.</a></p>
UID:20261218T180000Z-23949@calendar.santarosa.edu
